{"version":1,"content":"<p>Wacom 今日發佈新一代 Wacom Intuos 繪圖板 ( CTK41208、CTK6120），面向希望提升數字創作技能的初學者、興趣創作者和學生。</p><p>Wacom Intuos 搭載專為新晉創作者全新開發的數位筆 Wacom Lite Pen，並結合升級的書寫繪畫體驗、全新的互動式網頁教程，以及隨附的創意軟件與服務，讓數位創作的起步更加直觀、有趣，也更有成就感。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.358589+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:48:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:42.306119+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684399+00:00","content_hash":"c4a584c382352918efc1b3838fa5430182d1a9545668c96945fec5e0607108fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}